  "description_text": "Welcome to 10 Verdun Street, Dorchester! This charming home offers 3 generously sized bedrooms (originally a 4-bedroom layout with potential to convert back), living and dining rooms with French doors, and a spacious kitchen. Enjoy your own backyard oasis featuring a beautiful deck and charming pond. Major updates include a roof and water heater, both less than 3 years old! Additional features include a private driveway with off-street parking and a garage currently used for storage, with potential to convert back. Conveniently located just 3 minutes from the T and offering easy highway access for commuters. So much to offer! Come see all this home has to offer! First showing will be during open house Saturday November 14 from 3 to 4 pm! All offers due Monday by 5pm",
